{"4601690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Secrets of Thoth", "steam_appid": 4601690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover ancient secrets hidden beneath a remote Templar outpost in the Alps</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this atmospheric first-person adventure, you step into the role of Caelan a wayward Knight drawn into a world of forbidden knowledge, buried relics, and long-forgotten truths. What begins as an isolated expedition soon becomes a journey into mystery, where the line between history, myth, and revelation begins to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hauntingly beautiful world of mist-covered forests, silent lakes, ruined stone structures, glowing caves, and ancient sites touched by something far older than man. As you delve deeper, you will discover cryptic clues, forgotten writings, and the hidden legacy of the Tablets of Thoth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve environmental puzzles, uncover hidden paths, and piece together the story of a place shaped by secrecy and supernatural power. Each discovery draws you closer to an unsettling truth waiting beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a visually rich world inspired by medieval fantasy and ancient mystery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover hidden lore, relics, and secret locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and uncover the path forward</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an atmospheric journey filled with tension, wonder, danger and discovery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel a story centered on forbidden knowledge and ancient power</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey to seek the truth but some secrets were never meant to be found.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb